{% include "loading" %}

<style>
  .page-grid-1 {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    column-gap: 80px;
    row-gap: 0px;
    padding: 100px 40px 40px 40px;
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .page-grid-item {
    grid-column: span 1;
    display: flex;  
    flex-direction: column; 
    align-self: top;
  }
  img { 
    display: block; 
    width:100%; 
    height: auto;
  }
  .centered-img img {
    max-width: 700px; 
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 100px 0 40px;
  }
  .caption {
    padding-top: 6px;
    font-size: 10px;
    line-height: 14px;
    color: #666;
  } 
  .centered-article-text {
    font-size: 12px;
    width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 150%;
  }
  .graphics-article-title {
    display: block;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 20px;
    padding: 43px 20px 0 20px;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 440px;
    line-height: 26px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    opacity: 1;
    -moz-transition: all .3s ease-in-out;
    -webkit-transition: all .3s ease-in-out;
    -o-transition: all .3s ease-in-out;
    -ms-transition: all .3s ease-in-out;
    transition: all .3s ease-in-out;
  }
  .cover-image {
    padding: 100px 0;
    display: block;
    width: auto;
    height: auto;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }  
  .lookbook-shop-button {
    border: 1px solid #000;
    background-color: #fff;
    color: #000;
    max-width: 500px;
    display: block;
    margin: 0 auto;
    font-size: 14px;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 10px 10px;
    margin-bottom: 160px;
  }
  .lookbook-shop-button:active, .lookbook-shop-button:hover {
    background-color: #000;
    color: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #000;
  }
  .article-collection-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      column-gap: 16px;
      row-gap: 20px;
      padding: 20px 40px 40px 40px;
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: 0 auto;
  }
 
/************************ MEDIA QUERIES ************************************/
  
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .page-grid-1 {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      padding: 80px 10px 0px;
      row-gap: 10px;
    }
    .page-grid-item {
      grid-column: span 2;
    }
    .centered-article-text {
    	width: 100%;
    }
    .new-centered-article-text {
      padding-top: 140px!important;
    }
    .graphics-article-title {
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 26px;
      top: 67px;
      padding-top: 80px;
    }
    .cover-image {
      padding: 42px 0 80px 0;
      width: 100%;
    }
    .article-collection-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      column-gap: 16px;
      row-gap: 20px;
      padding: 20px;
    }
  }
  
  @media (max-width: 400px) {
    
  }
</style>

<img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0664/2387/files/aaa9B3A8434.jpg?v=1655230529" class="cover-image">

<div class="centered-article-text">
  We’re a global brand but some of us live, and all of us work, in our neighborhood of Greenpoint, Brooklyn. 
  Marcial, a former carpenter, is one of the local residents we see bopping around grabbing coffee or taking down errands. 
  In honor of Father’s Day, we asked him to be our surrogate for an afternoon and wear our SS22 Premium Buttondowns. 
  These are what we consider the perfect button-down for the summer months; a roomier fit in seasonally appropriate fabrics that are comfortable against the skin in some colors that belong in the sun. 
  Appropriate for fathers & sons alike. 
</div>

